# Trivy ignore list for fulmen-toolbox runner / sbom-tools images.
#
# Add CVEs here only with rationale and a date. Format:
#   <CVE-ID>  # YYYY-MM-DD: <rationale>; review by YYYY-MM-DD
# Example:
#   CVE-2026-00000  # 2026-05-04: false positive in trivy DB; upstream fixed in libfoo 1.2.3 already shipped; review 2026-08-04
#
# This file is read by the cve-scan workflow and by `make precommit` (trivy
# scan of Dockerfile sources). Keep entries minimal and time-boxed.

# --- v0.5.0 residuals: fixable upstream, but no fixed RELEASE of the shipped
# tool exists yet. We are on the latest upstream version of each; the fix lands
# in the tool's stdlib/deps only on an upstream rebuild. Planning item: re-check
# at the next fulmen-toolbox build and drop entries whose upstream has rebuilt
# (see .plans/active/v0.5.0/brief.md "follow-ups"). Not flaming upstream — these
# are very fresh 2026 CVEs and rebuilds lag normally.

# yq v4.53.2 (latest) prebuilt binary embeds go1.26.2 stdlib; fixed in go1.26.3+.
# We ship the official upstream binary; clears when mikefarah/yq rebuilds on a
# patched Go. (Building yq from source with our go1.26.4 would fix it but would
# diverge glibc from musl's apk yq-go and drop the official binary — declined.)
CVE-2026-33811  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-33814  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-39820  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-39823  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-39825  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-39826  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-39836  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05
CVE-2026-42499  # 2026-06-05: yq v4.53.2 stdlib (go1.26.2); fixed in go1.26.3+; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05

# grype v0.113.0 (latest) vendors github.com/docker/docker v28.5.2; fixed in
# v29.3.1. We ship the official upstream binary and cannot self-build grype's
# dep tree; clears when anchore/grype bumps the dep.
CVE-2026-34040  # 2026-06-05: grype v0.113.0 vendored docker/docker v28.5.2; fixed in 29.3.1; on-latest-upstream; review by 2026-09-05

# picomatch 4.0.3 is bundled inside the node base image's own npm
# (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/...), not a tool we install; fixed in 4.0.4.
# Clears when the node:22 base updates its bundled npm.
CVE-2026-33671  # 2026-06-05: picomatch 4.0.3 in node-base bundled npm; fixed in 4.0.4; base-bundled, not our dep; review by 2026-09-05
